## STEP 1 — DELTA
- [NEW] mirror.ipb.de — first individually-confirmed dedicated host: dedicated IPv6 `2a02:f28:2:0:194:29:226:88` (embedded IPv4 194.29.226.88), nginx 404 on `/`, HTTP→HTTPS 301. NOT wildcard-proxied.
- [NEW] speedtest.ipb.de — resolves (194.29.226.26) but ports 80/443 closed/no listener.
- [NEW] pluto.portal.ipb.de — live public unauth DRF endpoint: `/api/multi-tenancy/v1/user/request_reset_password/` returns 405 on GET (POST-only, NO auth header demanded); OPTIONS leaks full User serializer schema (email required; first_name/last_name/job_title/date_of_birth/phone_number writable; last_login/created_at/updated_at/last_login read_only; nested `tenant{id,name,created_by,updated_by}`). Only the 2nd public unauth API surface after `/api/ct/`.
- [NEW] pluto.portal.ipb.de — file-upload class surface: `/api/multi-tenancy/v1/user/profile-picture/{upload,download,delete}/` live, 401 unauth (auth-gated).
- [CHANGED] 21-unconfirmed-host gap effectively closed: focus/moderated/guest/auth.gold.ipb.de NXDOMAIN (no 2nd-level wildcard) — Jitsi `config.js` guest/anonymous/XMPP refs are config-only, no live hosts. Remaining inventory hosts NXDOMAIN or unreachable.
- [CHANGED] `/api/session/` OPTIONS public (no actions payload); `/reset_password/{t}/` detail = 401 unauth.

